      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-02-14T19:46:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The new USB_PD_MUX flag has 3 unused bits and the pd_cc_state enum is also needs 3 bit. So is the pd_cc_state enum going to expand more than 3 bits? If not, I can encode it in the new USB_PD_MUX flag itself.",
